          "id": "spf:user-experience-research",
          "name": "User Experience Research"
        }
      ],
      "summaryOfTheGaps": "Your background does not line up neatly with this kind of work, and that is normal. Most of these skills you will build fresh, and plenty of people have done exactly that. You will not learn all of this up front. Like the work itself, you grow into it a piece at a time, taking on a little more as you go.",
      "trainingRecommendations": "There is no single right path, but here is one sensible way to grow into it:\n\n\nThrough all of it, lean on what you already do well, like Interviewing and Survey Design. Those strengths give you something to stand on while the newer skills catch up.",
